            Whirlpool and GE are the most reliable refrigerator brands for most kitchens, with Bosch the pick for a counter-depth French door and Frigidaire the budget choice. LG and Samsung are fine buys for their features and efficiency, but their histories mean you should choose models carefully and keep the paperwork.
          </p>
